	(text "R7/R8 values are NOMINAL. Measure the actual pair on the DMM\nand store the measured ratio as a calibration constant in\nfirmware (oscil_cal.h). Ratio sets gain; sum sets input Z.\nAbsolute value does not matter, matching does."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.724 82.042 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "085796c1-ffef-4ff3-9747-15efcd44dac7")
	)
	(text "space reserved for ADC driver stage if settling is\nmarginal at 2MSa/s"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.072 43.434 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "0e294e2a-3705-4b14-86ec-780c2b11545c")
	)
	(text "Single-ended, NOT isolated. Shell = system GND = USB GND = mains earth.\nMax +/-5V direct, +/-50V with 10x probe. NEVER connect to mains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 49.53 53.848 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1ec3bf1b-0e40-4915-ba48-697ef3ba43be")
	)
	(text "Protection: R7 (750k) limits fault current.\n100V fault -> 133uA. BAV99 rated well above this.\nD2 limits voltage to rail +/- one diode drop.\nADS7883 abs max on VIN: -0.3V to VDD+0.3V (SLAS594 p.2)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112.268 72.898 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "32d5ced8-8e5b-4a83-865a-f2b3622a475e")
	)
	(text "Buffer: divider output impedance = 750k||250k = 188k.\nADS7883 needs source impedance < 200 ohm (SLAS594 p.11,\n\"Driving the VIN and VDD Pins\"). Buffer makes it a few ohms.\nMCP6292 rail-to-rail I/O, GBW 10MHz (DS20001812).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 136.906 90.678 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4f69c201-ab83-4ff2-bf00-39774d6b7039")
	)
	(text "Compensation: adjust C10 so R7*C10 = R8*C11\nTune with 1kHz square wave: flat top = correct,\nsagging = undercomp, overshoot = overcomp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.614 69.596 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "adae6755-0ce6-44aa-b920-e0841938db2d")
	)
	(text "Anti-alias + Riso + charge bucket. fc = 241kHz.\nR9 <= 200 ohm per ADS7883 SLAS594 p.11.\nC0G REQUIRED: X7R drifts with temp and DC bias,\nwhich would move the corner frequency.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.354 66.294 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f5b9e51d-45a6-43ef-8fba-725a6aafdd55")
	)
